// A world-placed pickup that offers the level-up upgrade-choice screen forced to ONE
// Editor-authored category, instead of the level-driven sequence a real level-up follows - see
// docs/chests.md. Collected the same walk-into-radius auto-collect way as ExpOrb/ScrapOrb/
// RiftShardOrb/CoinOrb (see ChestSystem) rather than through a new interact button - this project
// has no interact-button/prompt pattern anywhere today, and every existing pickup is pure
// auto-collect. Kind is set once in the Editor per chest prototype/instance (e.g. a "Weapon Chest"
// vs. a "Global Upgrade Chest") - NOT randomized at runtime, unlike a level-up's own per-level
// sequence lookup (see LevelUpConfig.LevelSequence).
component Chest
{
    LevelUpCategory Kind;
    FP PickupRadius;
    Boolean Opened;   // guards against being collected twice while the screen it opened is still
                       // resolving - ChestSystem destroys the entity once this is true.
}
